" height="100%" viewBox="-.75 -.5 36 36"><path d="M 5.5 11 h 23 v 1 l -11 6 l -11 -6 v -1 m 0 2 l 11 6 l 11 -6 v 11 h -22 v -11" stroke-width="1" fill="#fff"></path></svg></span></a><a class="heateor_sss_more" aria-label="More" title="More" rel="nofollow noopener" style="font-size: 32px!important;border:0;box-shadow:none;display:inline-block!important;font-size:16px;padding:0 4px;vertical-align: middle;display:inline;" href="https://1000logos.net/dana-logo/" onclick="event.preventDefault()"><span class="heateor_sss_svg" style="background-color:#ee8e2d;width:100px;height:30px;border-radius:0px;display:inline-block!important;opacity:1;float:left;font-size:32px!important;box-shadow:none;display:inline-block;font-size:16px;padding:0 4px;vertical-align:middle;display:inline;background-repeat:repeat;overflow:hidden;padding:0;cursor:pointer;box-sizing:content-box;" onclick="heateorSssMoreSharingPopup(this, 'https://1000logos.net/dana-logo/', 'Dana%20Logo', '' )"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="-.3 0 32 32" version="1.1" width="100%" height="100%" style="display:block;" xml:space="preserve"><g><path fill="#fff" d="M18 14V8h-4v6H8v4h6v6h4v-6h6v-4h-6z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></g></svg></span></a></div><div class="heateorSssClear"></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo.png"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTAwIDMzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgc3R5bGU9ImZpbGw6I2NmZDRkYjtmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk6IDAuMTsiLz48L3N2Zz4=" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-99298" data-src="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-500x333.png" alt="Dana logo" width="500" height="333" data-srcset="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-500x333.png 500w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-140x93.png 140w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-768x512.png 768w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo.png 1500w" data-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></a><em>Dana Logo PNG</em></p><p>Dana Wallet is a fintech company specializing in delivering inclusive financial services. It provides a payment service platform for clients all around Indonesia. It is headquartered in Jakarta, Jakarta Raya.</p><h2>Meaning and history</h2><p><a href="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo.jpg"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTAwIDMzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgc3R5bGU9ImZpbGw6I2NmZDRkYjtmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk6IDAuMTsiLz48L3N2Zz4=" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-99297" data-src="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-500x333.jpg" alt="Dana logo" width="500" height="333" data-srcset="https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-500x333.jpg 500w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-140x93.jpg 140w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo-768x512.jpg 768w, https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Dana-logo.jpg 1500w" data-sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></a></p><p>The company was founded in the summer of 2017. Its founder is Vincent Iswara.<br />
The Dana logo combines a simple emblem with the name of the brand. The overall style is pretty minimalist. The emblem is basically a blue circle housing a flag shape. The shape symbolizes a banknote representing the type of service the company provides.</p><h3>Font</h3><p>The typeface is very clean not only due to the lack of serifs but also due to other ways of simplifying the shape of the glyphs. For instance, the “N’s” have lost the “tails” in their top right corners.<br />
Also, the glyphs echo each other’s shape. The “A” and “N” have the same arc, while the only difference between them is the horizontal bar. The arc of the “D” looks the same, only it is rotated 90 degrees clockwise.</p><h3>Colors</h3><p>The shade of blue used in the Dana logo is a little brighter and more saturated than the color of the sky. It is rather unique and makes the design more recognizable.</p><div class="relpost-thumb-wrapper"><div class="relpost-thumb-container"><div style="clear: both"></div><div style="clear: both"></div><div class="relpost-block-container"><a href="https://1000logos.net/freddie-mac-logo/"class="relpost-block-single" ><div class="relpost-custom-block-single" style="width: 360px; height: 275px;"><div class="relpost-block-single-image" aria-hidden="true" role="img" style="background: transparent url(https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Freddie-Mac-Logo-thumb.png) no-repeat scroll 0% 0%; width: 360px; height: 200px;"></div><div class="relpost-block-single-text"  style="font-family: Oswald;  font-size: 17px;  color: #333333;">Freddie Mac Logo</div></div></a><a href="https://1000logos.net/moneygram-logo/"class="relpost-block-single" ><div class="relpost-custom-block-single" style="width: 360px; height: 275px;"><div class="relpost-block-single-image" aria-hidden="true" role="img" style="background: transparent url(https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/MoneyGram-Logo-thumb.png) no-repeat scroll 0% 0%; width: 360px; height: 200px;"></div><div class="relpost-block-single-text"  style="font-family: Oswald;  font-size: 17px;  color: #333333;">MoneyGram Logo</div></div></a><a href="https://1000logos.net/equifax-logo/"class="relpost-block-single" ><div class="relpost-custom-block-single" style="width: 360px; height: 275px;"><div class="relpost-block-single-image" aria-hidden="true" role="img" style="background: transparent url(https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Equifax-Logo-tumb.png) no-repeat scroll 0% 0%; width: 360px; height: 200px;"></div><div class="relpost-block-single-text"  style="font-family: Oswald;  font-size: 17px;  color: #333333;">Equifax Logo</div></div></a></div><div style="clear: both"></div></div></div></div></article></main></div><div id="secondary" class="widget-area"><aside id="custom_html-9" class="widget_text widget sidebar-widget widget_custom_html"><div class="widget-title">Subscribe</div><div class="textwidget custom-html-widget"><form action="https://app.convertkit.com/forms/6641341/subscriptions" class="seva-form formkit-form" method="post" id="fsub" data-sv-form="6641341" data-uid="7820078e8f" data-format="inline" data-version="5" data-options="{&quot;settings&quot;:{&quot;after_subscribe&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;success_message&quot;:&quot;Success! Now check your email to confirm your subscription.&quot;,&quot;redirect_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;analytics&quot;:{&quot;google&quot;:null,&quot;fathom&quot;:null,&quot;facebook&quot;:null,&quot;segment&quot;:null,&quot;pinterest&quot;:null,&quot;sparkloop&quot;:null,&quot;googletagmanager&quot;:null},&quot;modal&quot;:{&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;timer&quot;,&quot;scroll_percentage&quot;:null,&quot;timer&quot;:5,&quot;devices&quot;:&quot;all&quot;,&quot;show_once_every&quot;:15},&quot;powered_by&quot;:{&quot;show&quot;:false,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://convertkit.com/features/forms?utm_campaign=poweredby&amp;utm_content=form&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=dynamic&quot;},&quot;recaptcha&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:false},&quot;return_visitor&quot;:{&quot;action&quot;:&quot;show&quot;,&quot;custom_content&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;slide_in&quot;:{&quot;display_in&quot;:&quot;bottom_right&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;timer&quot;,&quot;scroll_percentage&quot;:null,&quot;timer&quot;:5,&quot;devices&quot;:&quot;all&quot;,&quot;show_once_every&quot;:15},&quot;sticky_bar&quot;:{&quot;display_in&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;timer&quot;,&quot;scroll_